  "body": "**[Original report](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/issues/96) by Daniel Catalina (Bitbucket: [Daniel Catalina](https://bitbucket.org/Daniel Catalina), ).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nI have noticed that when you open ART if you go directly to the Queue windows all the options are available for the file format no matter if you choose there tiff or jpeg as the output file:\n\n* if JPEG was last selected, also the 'Uncompressed TIFF is there\n\n![](https://bitbucket.org/repo/9pArXyE/images/1677449480-SharedScreenshot2.jpg)\n* if TIFF was last selected also JPEG Quality is visible.\n\n![](https://bitbucket.org/repo/9pArXyE/images/2080489073-SharedScreenshot.jpg)\n‌\n\nIt kind of fixes itself as soon as you choose a file format again, just when you first open the Queue window this can be seen.\n\n‌\n",
